{"unit_id":"Algorandius__dsh-disk-janitor#card-zh","repo":"Algorandius/dsh-disk-janitor","commit":"c661f7c814c8a81c9c3d57a092592de8d9f3e1d9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Disk Janitor 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的磁盘清理插件。它在设置页加入磁盘占用面板，并注册 disk_janitor 对话工具，同时提供本地 HTTP 接口。用户可以查看 DSH 数据目录和缓存分类的体积，按类别清理图片预览、会话投影、旧 Bash 运行时、临时目录及桌面渲染缓存，也可以设置定时清理。适合想了解 DSH 磁盘占用并整理可重建文件的用户。自动清理默认关闭；无需 API Key 或外部账号，配置保存在 DSH_HOME 下。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:626-631","index.js:45-112","index.js:141-169","lib/janitor.js:58-97","lib/settings.js:17-20"]}
{"unit_id":"Algorandius__dsh-disk-janitor#card-en","repo":"Algorandius/dsh-disk-janitor","commit":"c661f7c814c8a81c9c3d57a092592de8d9f3e1d9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Disk Janitor adds a disk usage panel to DSH Web Settings and a disk_janitor chat tool. It scans usage and cleans selected image, session, Bash runtime, temporary, and desktop caches. Optional scheduled cleanup is off by default. It needs no API key or account; settings stay under DSH_HOME.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:626-631","index.js:45-112","index.js:141-169","lib/janitor.js:58-97","lib/settings.js:17-20"]}
