{"unit_id":"Algorandius__dsh-disk-janitor#feature-1","repo":"Algorandius/dsh-disk-janitor","commit":"c661f7c814c8a81c9c3d57a092592de8d9f3e1d9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Disk Janitor 的功能「分类查看磁盘占用」：扫描 DSH 数据目录总量并列出可清理类别的大小和文件数。在设置页载入面板或点击重新扫描时触发，结果展示各缓存分类和占用靠前的目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/janitor.js:169-200","client.js:450-500"]}
